# GPU bench: native vs Omni-Compass, metered by the device

GPU NVIDIA A10, driver 570.148.08, persistence mode Enabled, start power limit 150.00 W, workload tools/gpu_workload.py (seeded fp16 matmul request stream).
3 repetitions, order rotated, 180.0 s per arm plus 30.0 s drain, 30.0 s idle before each arm.

Phase: **smoke**. Omni frozen at commit 8e62252e1f28; file hashes in FREEZE.json, rechecked at the end.

